# Bell Pair via Qiskit backend
#
# Same circuit as bell_pair.aeth but compiled to Qiskit
# and executed on the Aer local simulator.
#
# To run on real IBM hardware, change to:
#   infer BellPair using qiskit(shots=1024, backend="ibm_brisbane")
#
# The Qiskit backend shows:
#   - Circuit depth and gate count
#   - ASCII circuit diagram
#   - Same entanglement results as our simulator

quantum circuit BellPair:
    qubit q0
    qubit q1

    gate hadamard(target=q0)
    gate cnot(control=q0, target=q1)

    measure q0
    measure q1

infer BellPair using qiskit(shots=1024)
